        definition("direction_feedback", "Read feedback on the next user request. Returns original cut context, source anchors, the words said there (a short excerpt and their count; direction_transcript has the timed words with ids for word cuts) and a cursor. Use since to read updated/new comments incrementally. Loop while hasMore.", ["since": integer]),
